{"lines": ["Over a hundred students say a silver disc dropped behind their school.", "Melbourne, April nineteen sixty-six. At morning break, students and a teacher look up at a round, silent, silver shape.", "A science teacher says it rose again, a silver streak chased by five light planes.", "But a check later shows no commercial, private, or air force pilot reported anything unusual.", "The next day's paper says: perhaps a weather balloon, released miles away.", "Students find flattened grass, but accounts vary between one circle and three.", "Air force men search the field and find nothing. The landowner burns the grass.", "Skeptics say one plane may have towed a target drogue. No record of such an exercise was found.", "So was it a balloon and a drogue, or a silver disc behind their school?"], "words": [["Over", 0.0, 0.2], ["a", 0.2, 0.24], ["hundred", 0.24, 0.44], ["students", 0.44, 1.02], ["say", 1.02, 1.26], ["a", 1.26, 1.38], ["silver", 1.38, 1.64], ["disc", 1.64, 1.96], ["dropped", 1.96, 2.26], ["behind", 2.26, 2.64], ["their", 2.64, 2.94], ["school.", 2.94, 3.22], ["Melbourne,", 3.783, 4.06], ["April", 4.12, 4.7], ["nineteen", 4.7, 5.07], ["sixty-six.", 5.07, 5.44], ["At", 6.38, 6.44], ["morning", 6.44, 6.62], ["break,", 6.62, 7.04], ["students", 7.46, 7.78], ["and", 7.78, 8.14], ["a", 8.14, 8.26], ["teacher", 8.26, 8.4], ["look", 8.4, 8.8], ["up", 8.8, 8.94], ["at", 8.94, 9.1], ["a", 9.1, 9.14], ["round,", 9.14, 9.44], ["silent,", 9.74, 10.14], ["silver", 10.52, 10.76], ["shape.", 10.76, 11.16], ["A", 11.642, 11.72], ["science", 11.72, 11.94], ["teacher", 11.94, 12.36], ["says", 12.36, 12.76], ["it", 12.76, 12.92], ["rose", 12.92, 13.08], ["again,", 13.08, 13.44], ["a", 13.96, 14.02], ["silver", 14.02, 14.26], ["streak", 14.26, 14.7], ["chased", 14.7, 15.02], ["by", 15.02, 15.32], ["five", 15.32, 15.7], ["light", 15.7, 15.9], ["planes.", 15.9, 16.16], ["But", 16.96, 17.02], ["a", 17.02, 17.12], ["check", 17.12, 17.3], ["later", 17.3, 17.68], ["shows", 17.